%% draw-visual:
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P0 as CLI
  participant P1 as agent-plane
  participant P2 as PostgreSQL
  participant P3 as vmagent
  participant P4 as Command
  P0->>P1: input 1 for X1
  P1->>P3: input 1
  P3->>P4: stdin bytes
  P3->>P1: ack 1
  P1->>P0: 1 delivered
  P0->>P1: input 2
  P1->>P3: input 2
  P3->>P4: stdin bytes
  P3-xP1: ack 2
  P1->>P2: 2 uncertain
  P1->>P0: 2 uncertain
  Note over P1: never resend automatically
  P0->>P1: end of input
  P1->>P3: close input
  P3->>P4: close stdin
  P3->>P1: input closed
  P1->>P0: input closed
